If the VAX Station is running TCP/IP:

1 Start you PC Xserver
2.Telnet to your Vax Station
3. type the commands:
         $set display/create/transport=tcpip/node=<node>
         $create/term/detach
   This will bring up a decterm on your PC.

4. You can also start and Xsession by typing:
          $run sys$system:decw$session
    For some reason you cannot run this detached, so you'll have to keep the

    window from which you start the Xsession open.

   - Nathan

