definetely a multisync monitor, but there was something goofy about the
D-sub VGA connector that prevented us from using it (We found this out when
we moved some of these monitors from older model 3000 alphas to AlphaStation
255 & 500s, as well as when one of our enterprising staff members decided to
hook his PC up to it.)

