I don't recall that TS included even one word about "price/performance" in his
article (perhaps he should have - but that's a different question). He was
clearly presenting the presumed pricing of the latest/greatest Compaq
Alphaservers and related second-party Alpha-based products.

Based on that, I respectfully submit that if we're going to compare apples to
apples pricing (shoot - that might draw in the dreaded Macophiles! We're in
trouble now! ;^) let's try to keep it pure: the latest/greatest from BOTH
sides - not some arbitrarily chosen set of combatants such as you provide -
with the specific intent of proving an entirely different point.

