the appropriate cables. It looks like this: 
(from http://www.fips.de/computer/mv3500_e.html)

|    C1   |      |   C2    |     |  C3  |
+---------+      +---------+     +------+
+---+-------+---+-------+-------+-------+
| O |   o   | O |   o   |   o   |   o   |
+---+-------+---+-------+-------+-------+
  A     1     C     3       5       7

+---+-------+---+-------+-------+-------+
| O |   o   | O |   o   |   o   |   o   |
+---+-------+---+-------+-------+-------+
  B     2     D     4       6       8

    +-------+       _____ 
    |   o   |       |____|
    +-------+
        9             E

A-E are LEDs only. E is power-on.
1-2 are taster
3-9 are switches - 9 results in a 'HLT'
All others are unknown.

C1 and C2 are 20 pol. and NOT connected.
C3 is 10 pol. and connected to CPU board.

I think I hardly need the connectors C1 and C2 to get my disks online and
to boot machine completly.
Someone knows the meaning of buttons and LED's ?
Someone knows the pinout of C1 and C2 and how to connect them to the
CPU board?

ciao
