thousands of apps ready for it and they will make a lot of noise about it.

As soon as the games will start coming out native Merced, you can bet that
Dell&co will start to produce home PCs based on Merced at commodity prices. (I
say within 2-3 years, probably less).

And guess what, the first merceds will be configured and priced as servers.
And microsoft and gang will start making claims of the first to have 64 bit
software etc etc. ALPHA will not even be mentioned.

The heards will run like hell towards merced, abandonning the 8086 in droves
and adopting merced at a fairly fast pace.

We are not talking about an architecture change here, we are talking about
mass movement of a heard of sheep from one paddock to another.



