The Alpha market contraction seems to have started already. 

This quarters IDC figures show CPQ/Digital workstation revenues falling 
13% on unit volume up 4%. This is of course combined UNIX/NT on Alpha 
and on Intel and does not break out the Alpha/NT or Alpha/UNIX. 

