whatever this is, it
was the bootable storage controller (the scavenger apparently didn't
open the card cage, just the front panel to pull the drives).

And what is a KLESI (M7740) anyway?  Can I use it for anything ?  Is it
worth something?

I can put either or both into another (working) MVII, which has VMS
